", "memory_type": "time", "status": "completed", "identify_brief": "共6人 · 空间：一个办公室或工作区域｜这段语音主要讨论了如何设计一个“随身的AI秘书”，该秘书不仅能记住客户遗漏的细节（如承诺、会议内容），还能关联人脸图像、对话内容以及世界上的音响信息。它强调了这种秘书集成了云端AI的能力，并涉及了数据安全和隐私保护。语音中还提到了一个实验或测试过程，涉及到“黑盒子”和“保护盒子端”的设置，以及对某些问题的考查。", "title": "ONSITE 记录", "scene": "onsite", "partition": "work", "started_at": "2026-07-10 12:23:41", "duration_seconds": 4693, "evidence_status": "ready", "is_favorited": false}, {"memory_id": "00ed22e7-e9f4-485e-be47-ab2e802ae031", "memory_type": "time", "status": "processing", "identify_brief": "", "title": "ONSITE 记录", "scene": "onsite", "partition": "work", "started_at": "2026-07-10 12:20:36", "duration_seconds": 0, "evidence_status": "pending", "is_favorited": false}, {"memory_id": "1659c363-c85f-47bd-92f8-64f849475d81", "memory_type": "time", "status": "processing", "identify_brief": "", "title": "ONSITE 记录", "scene": "onsite", "partition": "work", "started_at": "2026-07-10 12:12:47", "duration_seconds": 0, "evidence_status": "pending", "is_favorited": false}, {"memory_id": "ffb071db-6ad0-5d73-b4c5-69e1a62db487", "memory_type": "time", "status": "completed", "identify_brief": "共2人 · 空间：眼镜厂会议室与样品评审桌，桌上有儿童 TR90 镜架、样品盒和 SentrixOne 端侧盒子｜识境浦经理向刘总演示 Onsite 现场拜访记录：捕捉客户样品修改、交付承诺和数据安全顾虑，并推动两周送样评估。", "title": "💓 眼镜厂 Onsite 销售拜访", "scene": "onsite", "partition": "work", "started_at": "2026-07-09 18:45:00", "duration_seconds": 90, "evidence_status": "ready", "is_favorited": true}, {"memory_id": "3684a17e-2973-48aa-a0be-92aa12750306", "memory_type": "time", "status": "completed", "identify_brief": "共0人 · 空间：一个室内工作或学习区域，有电脑、键盘、鼠标等设备｜无语音内容", "title": "ONSITE 记录", "scene": "onsite", "partition": "work", "started_at": "2026-07-09 18:33:39", "duration_seconds": 14, "evidence_status": "ready", "is_favorited": false}, {"memory_id": "90e17fa3-122a-4414-8970-2d356bc1b0e3", "memory_type": "time", "status": "completed", "identify_brief": "共3人 · 空间：客户现场会议区，桌面有演示电脑、样机和白板｜完成 Echo 眼镜现场演示，确认离线记录、人物库和会后追问能力可用于下周试点。", "title": "ONSITE 客户试点演示", "scene